  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5910,
      "text": "By the sky full of constellations,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5911,
      "text": "and by the promised Day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5912,
      "text": "and by the witness and the witnessed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5913,
      "text": "cursed be the makers of the trench[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5914,
      "text": "the fire full of fuel,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5915,
      "text": "when they sat around it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5916,
      "text": "and were witnessing what they did to the believers[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5917,
      "text": "Their only grievance against them was that they believed in Allah, the All-Mighty, the Praiseworthy,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5918,
      "text": "to Whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and earth, and Allah is Witness over all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5919,
      "text": "Indeed, for those who tortured the believing men and women, and then did not repent, there will be the punishment of Hell and the punishment of the burning fire[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5920,
      "text": "But those who believed and did righteous deeds will certainly have gardens under which rivers flow; that is the supreme triumph.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5921,
      "text": "Indeed, the punishment of your Lord is severe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5922,
      "text": "Indeed, it is He Who originates [the creation] and then resurrects all,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5923,
      "text": "and He is the All-Forgiving, the Most Affectionate,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5924,
      "text": "the Lord of the Glorious Throne;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5925,
      "text": "He does whatever He wills.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5926,
      "text": "Has there not come to you the story of the forces",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5927,
      "text": "of Pharaoh and Thamūd?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5928,
      "text": "But the disbelievers are in persistent denial,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5929,
      "text": "although Allah encompasses them from all sides.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 590,
      "ruku": 527,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5930,
      "text": "But this is a glorious Qur’an,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 85,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البُرُوجِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Burooj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Constellations",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
